  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "2ed9fe30-abcf-463a-8caa-526dff27256a",
      "title": "Leia as três perguntas e use esse filtro mental antes de cada nova frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "72e6c06f-cb3d-4252-8fcc-309e7650eb8b",
          "textContent": "<p>Nesta aula, o verbo muda conforme o lugar do grupo na conversa.</p><ul><li><strong>me inclui</strong>?</li><li><strong>fala com o grupo</strong>?</li><li><strong>fala de outro grupo</strong>?</li></ul><p>Antes de cada nova frase, tente decidir isso primeiro. Depois olhe a forma de <strong>tener</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5a085a8c-c408-4913-a08c-a9dd1339be36",
      "title": "Olhe a cena, escute a frase e observe a forma verbal em destaque.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e7081773-6231-43e7-ae39-552ac13b3ea5",
          "textContent": "<p>Olhe a cena, escute e leia.</p><p><strong>Tenemos dos bolígrafos.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Nós temos duas canetas.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7b6d40f4f4a14b8ea474af3aff1d14db_b02-tenemos-dos-boligrafos.png?Expires=1794099429&Signature=u0GO7ycamiTsuwz3FGQA76hbEwrLgkTZiLAUt90l9Itkpl~3ee~YMYGz4jY6MDuqzJsKEHhsdd8qoEFb3QJn8uLWiX44Hi5aeRSwy7qxs62RM9ye3fl7D7vbaIJUlVNE7S2zg0orN8D7YGrY0le5O~iWecKG~z-eWcsW6wBm577f~IkLD99BpmQGiSyMVd5QEy97KsZVnvZhSNrEM3Vmi3f4LEHrbUryhNsKYpiktLbTJ0WM8-adsK9fkdkQi5tAMZHLuC53IFI7qwNXDm3Ylxa6gAtkInKNSZrjOtadAXQUdqNynj4DP0E1aK7TnBasqCjxmtLAQ0fcXM2UjPpkvg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/af3a7e28146e42bdbb9954eab636a4df_b02-tenemos-dos-boligrafos.mp3?Expires=1794099429&Signature=dag-oARJXfD1xF0tBslblV0rCRhKM90OswOyllW9KdYMbez0tRsjzkbBD~pTNRl-IFnTrmZYnLkJoqf7qo6I4k-K5XBGlF3kha94cP63wr21OmdqbvePHWL3R3vEG-lY8VvLZvUJJDuRNmseRt31IawbjtKCVij9Pntg-Lv~t-QaaweG1pN4E1coIriGY7mWEoicFhQgM05tEn8KOHBVJ1ixVdOHmKXNKBW4E-XbZFbkLjpA5etwfKgYjo~KE9MCfGmFS9d05GG3mrQM-ony~aqtKv2YCy02IGRmUd7vfiEpPHsD-EDwdpZNVOqoCPUUhdn9Pn0Pj0vQ4t8Th7C~Mw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "53689ef4-7e48-4349-b460-16b1ae2e59fb",
      "title": "Escute a nova frase e confirme mentalmente se a pessoa que fala está dentro do grupo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "61c19bb2-c565-4729-a7e5-7e048418832a",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a forma aparece com o pronome.</p><p><strong>Nosotras tenemos tres libros.</strong></p><p>Quando você ouve <strong>tenemos</strong>, quem fala está <strong>dentro</strong> do grupo.</p><p>A pergunta útil aqui é: <strong>eu faço parte desse \"nós\"?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4f237a1b11d74177ba1f5518520c7b45_b03-nosotras-tenemos-tres-libros.mp3?Expires=1794099429&Signature=elViNuF6wWbe9q2MPSB0o3fxY~CzAUJpEsoHKx9T~c54B~E0eythrH1pEPDpOaTt7Vs4Y-7xRbxeBnpaSJrWVeoWfz1cqDfNJVHNWE9IUTboMujT7Wcs2NERduVp6SHQYy5FQ6958eTTeDG85dZ9gbqwyFPjr80QGGR0lxnw3rTjb-aT7sxg~fY52YRqwWYm~84raOj5iX5qgkgIBGtOeLJlXjQujFsqby1xjw5WaHlnd-Zf0oA4PZPBESEUqata8kUQhHB1fxLbRoZzj61MrwuGI12BGurg7AMb5YzCXJ3MTTTKiqHVZXLHrKWheIfVhGZG4kJBRB6dCQlRJ77W3Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "34945133-0684-4d6e-bf53-4d9ef0e40f2c",
      "title": "Olhe a cena, escute a frase e repare que agora a fala se dirige a várias pessoas.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1fabfe04-4961-4b81-97cc-c11695ef6f65",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a frase fala <strong>com</strong> várias pessoas.</p><p><strong>Tenéis un número nuevo.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Vocês têm um número novo.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1544bcc26b7a4939b9a2fddc1697da73_b04-teneis-un-numero-nuevo.png?Expires=1794099429&Signature=aQ6I-A6394KBtcf0aXXeCgqbO13ura7NAdQShbvjosSjozBmgRlyh6xpnutgq5YQRbHnSJW~hda7l2CK3N5dF2M-SJNWyaQGXdDzte3uEBp3iUwCL45txxRPrcvxXiqepmDJC0DZiySkQOuzkY3afrr-OfB-mHIKLcf1cIjSRQ2tiwgWjpyYRp4dj~otHFrPQqJGuwQOVQR0xsIXxGh8QKicnGFL0AJW2Pacuqv~3fpSLzItS05RN~NFABcFm2N14I8m-JVAteJ6qCMj2tPQO6Br8hHYRjo1ViaOV2tAiH8w6VVftmqPrtvkHuYW7wmCpT6LFpvTD2JwvSfBkwyMkw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b74f62becaf94d8e9a0d18a18ecd0994_b04-teneis-un-numero-nuevo.mp3?Expires=1794099429&Signature=TS2dotIdDz76FYYeGAUq0xilwqGdbgSlEGEa2oER4FWUnSVnJukvzDZI1T--EGZdKXZrXRppXOzEyRwCsziVJ4XTVtq73JyUWdefs0EydK2q~61lDKrEOrUBetWWIkt-eSpKOJrUjdQJ1~k11w0NeuVe38hqVL2~tm7S1ZQR~COJ1Ew8nip9n8-OvZCFoXp2T3lmMtH6UgfZFvPg19tG9nB66FpLVjExet9GfcUxYLOt7vnbjxouV7ikgwLi0z76tVbtob3BsJiOzs-P9-a2CPMA6cdAjCFzYZ86VgiDRCyITVTOOuAC~fGuQtVcVBvtMTfojTunphO-kLM5xjZB7Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6bcc9c63-a65f-421b-8cfa-c90b492342db",
      "title": "Escute o novo exemplo e observe que o grupo recebe a fala diretamente.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "ff6df6ab-5b61-4a7a-a3c5-1e382139f692",
          "textContent": "<p>Veja a forma com o pronome.</p><p><strong>Vosotros tenéis dos libros aquí.</strong></p><p><strong>tenéis</strong> combina com <strong>vosotros / vosotras</strong> e fala <strong>com</strong> o grupo.</p><p>Essa forma aparece sobretudo no espanhol da Espanha, mas vale reconhecê-la na leitura e na escuta.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/95ee06d9a11c4d67b44acb1885aab15e_b05-vosotros-teneis-dos-libros-aqui.mp3?Expires=1794099429&Signature=TpxuuFPzkRqi3SrNZQw6fqXeVML4~pOFtJ-jgmNRtdn6OctKQwDUtBqyDJEmFDOQk3fyg8wnBSkFf~vYG3nceFMHup1TVIiwpxtc~Us6Ka6t7ukZO8EMs8KHMuO54JH3oS7aJliG4cUINRoHwcM22eTqAq9-cO6F1qHeGSR9VsGyasbgj7MiAFyYWOlWebmG5l1rFwj408vBQLFGBr6qB1Kh-RtezCyfvYD2SSwUA6tU5iaIEP1IhDzLO0hFKv5yB4cruRshD6PDstnChgBz~Yw6dL40uZQJdWPZID-OjSzh4rpm3fue21l32-6zco1SwrlQDQBRkfKZJX2LgwX-xg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9b45a0fd-8b3b-4df2-91d2-19177b45b0c6",
      "title": "Olhe a cena, escute a frase e note que o grupo agora está fora da conversa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "fd23515e-0746-441c-893a-987754dfda48",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a frase fala de <strong>outro grupo</strong>.</p><p><strong>Ellas tienen una casa bonita.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Elas têm uma casa bonita.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d26be605ff4c4aa099e6ef685d5fe3ea_b06-ellas-tienen-una-casa-bonita.png?Expires=1794099429&Signature=qNiIkymBYuXOOikrwrE8tMpFWJE7f45mepgmiYD4WCkjLxGzFWnnUMFcArqqQx1F7mPahwPRkPLCYmv-9xVlPC2SzRhxjMtKZ3H00Sn7ITMF7A8W2DyQnr7zNCMMH0KHoAs6BvL4-b-SSeS5yy0j3d0Z9fsf-g0~o75QNyzTbCaDBpBk~KrI9P7GR6tPn0aHCgbm0QYM957mBCSL85rYZ77iwp06SqfaaHYMsa0hCjkOvIso6tY7V1sA2EtfebKYCTOshsszHKE~rqr4Vl76E6p08BBjn8WzguNVTjq4XaXarIq1mo59O5CrjA8Ude0CTsKSf7~bzylMdd06nKc1qQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/2f9f7be577bd4b97a402cc445fafbbb5_b06-ellas-tienen-una-casa-bonita.mp3?Expires=1794099429&Signature=1vsf-xAo6vLXuKLMoXxEscWeGvmofuK1JAFDPRBIkyG-SkMzoJC2-Tjobgt8LYkszqzzts09GLbhZt1pCQUfcjzUuyAWRHSVu4vTwrKfLL9Bbn4oFUqV0EdgcDf6aIgH~1QHoO-Cmsz4w~Bu~nHxB~5~dJknOHtD~ied3ty2q7a99oyc2evyOqYGUwt25UXhh-LHeVFX9Bapj9N8dO4UvTDkja~D1anQkv2e~IptNB8llAo3hVVUq6qz9VYY79RYx3cyXvQgOuIB708s1VWh~mjV5td41PQLdIchMaVc0t5r2qJUI7EwrHBAqu8Jfn-kE2aMj5if0GVc4vEqL1XgfA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "315f9376-67aa-4221-9889-982cda546158",
      "title": "Escute o novo exemplo e repare que o grupo continua fora da conversa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "517b813e-9b1b-48e9-9116-a264b1edb8a1",
          "textContent": "<p>Mais um exemplo com o grupo fora da conversa.</p><p><strong>Ellos tienen un coche nuevo.</strong></p><p>Neste contraste da aula, <strong>tienen</strong> ajuda a reconhecer um grupo de quem se fala.</p><p>A pista mental é: <strong>não sou eu e não estou falando com esse grupo agora</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/568e5c20a0594064b546657a3553a842_b07-ellos-tienen-un-coche-nuevo.mp3?Expires=1794099429&Signature=VaOxyl3Rsh6Lthb~3Ocg0TlfWcxRoDrWWKq0sjAd9ma2d87bY7djDB7srBgYEzpvlkc5uC137tVvYBnHrHiO7g4-sHLDEO~kynw8veSkbnug95piHzNwJOT6X4QzrhDcSI3Jhxh3gXp3OHEAxlU3nYPIKLyJV-nQ2skHHvFYSw45wcU5MksEIlhJB9YAxve3s6iLUV4NxqGzZSwN8dfGWK6T4xEKyagC3dihZZ0Ofjv-NZCIfA7wo0eEeJRGP108PqOGZlN8K3c6cxIeuXfhH53sse~DrV3qtwsyWwP6wm0YikQZT0mqdRMfqXwjdf6kYOl5InEYt-F8-S9bkqsrFg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e110a200-f621-419d-ad76-5bbbf91859bf",
      "title": "Leia as três perguntas de novo e use esse filtro mental antes do próximo áudio.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 8,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "6a3a77de-c849-4d02-82f3-4fd708aa9280",
          "textContent": "<p>Antes do próximo áudio, faça a mesma leitura mental em três passos.</p><ul><li><strong>me inclui</strong>?</li><li><strong>fala com o grupo</strong>?</li><li><strong>fala de outro grupo</strong>?</li></ul><p>Escute primeiro o verbo. Depois confira o restante da frase.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d296792b-8b29-41c9-933a-ad9f4cd19805",
      "title": "Escute a sequência e tente notar quem entra em cena antes de reler as frases.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 9,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "df743043-3705-4e8c-9b26-d6b0c9ae60ef",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora os pronomes aparecem para deixar cada grupo bem visível.</p><ul><li><strong>Nosotras tenemos dos bolígrafos.</strong></li><li><strong>Vosotros tenéis un número nuevo.</strong></li><li><strong>Ellos tienen un coche nuevo.</strong></li></ul><p>Na escuta, tente notar quem entra em cena antes de reler.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8d34418dd91643b6839557ecb4cac754_b09-contraste-con-pronombres.mp3?Expires=1794099429&Signature=yZsCWXnzrLAlrOD6TmoivzvnHhz1774G7128KSph0iXMOAcuC~NqY-NCSk1e9xQzpSQU94EQfga8DfWohvVCYReDqBNrgz5DQFEMyp~VW9w1E31w-kIAnX5hmgdqVeNTPBQu00tzNx6dQkBQf~lUnQNMVGxufLsxgpLWCSrK~AOJnwoVSd2ad2XI8w~12ywgFdORT7E1lK8bV9sj-kHGFvrLc8J6TUjsq514ExTMGQVphG5tmZqi3J3yPrvl7UQpBrQn6B-MOrj3e9CFWebEvVWnYzMZjdHDNEaAcFkAoHJ9HWcJ0lHD9N8WLQX8gd9n5K5wny75u4BcslOMNoQ~IA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1b2ca6ed-0673-4595-82bc-97e5c071347f",
      "title": "Escute a nova sequência e repare no que continua igual quando os pronomes somem.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 10,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1f0338d2-c870-4def-b6e3-7cee17b682b7",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora os pronomes somem, mas a pista continua no verbo.</p><ul><li><strong>Tenemos dos bolígrafos.</strong></li><li><strong>Tenéis un número nuevo.</strong></li><li><strong>Tienen un coche nuevo.</strong></li></ul><p>Mesmo em frases curtas, a forma de <strong>tener</strong> já orienta a leitura.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/122946d848274d5ca6feb1aa8a7aa3f0_b10-contraste-sin-pronombres.mp3?Expires=1794099429&Signature=t2jLXMRALuVzEyazNnbkWQFwalCQpe3cDg-RQob8YPOg4F-kYTpPcy9W-qisuPm-7j0o6qAmoJFKupnjreWM0KQRINn6qS11VIwAtLnqymBTnO4~4tsTHCe6~gHug3l3fd3gZLnHN3cY4gsUTPMWetGNJwqIJ61kS~bzKdn7rRRsiQKf7PfUinT8i205zMvc9KCNNrpWNt-xnjMWOCb8a-z~SRczAKpyBpLyOPS-XZ605Um1aLQX7B62bZVX8et1WGYSlD9nE78txUQ2TgPWLzmo4fSLqboHw6oEWtcmoPxgh5MF9fQkLRoBWE5j7neVhtCpwZmvAMZq3iseKhuejw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3885e8b5-e956-4439-8bde-8983035b2255",
      "title": "Leia o mapa e relacione cada forma ao tipo de grupo que aparece na frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 11,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "588491aa-62d3-4fa9-8ace-2e467eefbbf4",
          "textContent": "<p>Junte as três pistas em um mapa curto.</p><ul><li><strong>tenemos</strong>: o grupo me inclui</li><li><strong>tenéis</strong>: eu falo com o grupo</li><li><strong>tienen</strong>: eu falo de outro grupo</li></ul><p>Se o pronome não aparece, volte primeiro para a forma verbal.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e24fad18-0583-4e7f-a716-f6164b195c7e",
      "title": "Leia o fechamento e conecte cada forma a um uso concreto do dia a dia.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 12,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c70bdc2d-7ffc-4e79-885a-9717babc09fd",
          "textContent": "<p>Na vida real, estas formas aparecem quando um grupo organiza objetos, recebe um contato novo ou comenta o que outras pessoas têm.</p><ul><li><strong>Tenemos dos bolígrafos.</strong> para falar do que está com o seu grupo.</li><li><strong>Tenéis un número nuevo.</strong> para falar com várias pessoas ao mesmo tempo.</li><li><strong>Ellas tienen una casa bonita.</strong> para comentar sobre outro grupo.</li></ul><p>Com esse contraste, fica mais fácil entender quem está em jogo mesmo antes de ouvir a frase inteira.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5546a8e0-3a25-4b72-a81b-1601ee32372c",
      "title": "Acompanhe a explicação",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 2,
      "sequenceItem": 13,
      "items": [
        {
